<title>USA: NPC acquires 51 Pizza Huts for $29.9 mln.</title>
<headline>NPC acquires 51 Pizza Huts for $29.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH, Kan. 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>NPC International Inc, a Pizza Hut restaurant franchisee, said Thursday it has completed the acqusition of 51 Pizza Hut Inc units in North Dakota, South Dakota and Minnesota for $29.9 million.</p>
<p>Pizza Hut Inc is a unit of PepsiCo Inc.</p>
<p>NPC said it also expects to acquire one more Pizza Hut in Minnesota after Pizza Hut Inc repairs flood damage.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
